    "detailed_description": "Aura Wallpaper enables animated desktop &amp;&amp; lockscreen wallpapers on Windows 10 and 11.<br>It enables the display of any HTML page, for example Websites or YouTube videos on your Windows desktop or lockscreen.<br><br><strong><u>How to use Aura:</u></strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Start Aura and right click the Aura logo in your task bar<br></li><li> Click on <strong>Select Wallpaper</strong><br></li><li> Browse for your favorite video<br></li><li> Fast forward to the point you want your wallpaper to start<br></li><li> Click <strong>Set LockScreen Wallpaper</strong><br></li><li> The video is now your lockscreen wallpaper starting at the same timepoint</li></ul><br>Performance and resource usage is optimized: For lockscreen wallpapers Aura Wallpaper will not consume any resources unless your PC is locked.",
